# Layer 3, business flow "hazelcast": AMPS as the persistence store behind
# Hazelcast open source IMaps (hazelcast-persistent-store module).
#
# Nothing here needs to differ from the repo defaults -- same ports, same
# binary, same platform. This file exists so every flow folder has the same
# two files and the layering order stays uniform; see
# docs/src/server-env-layering.md.
#
# No optional modules: two composite-key SOW topics ("tiers") are the whole
# configuration, so any AMPS build runs this flow.
